From cdd4b8a6bc8fabdff32e51434c890da8140354ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suvojeet-sengupta <suvojitsengupta21@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:53:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] release: cp2a: Turn on App Lock

Enable Android 17's App Lock: the PackageManager APIs and the core
feature, which ask for the screen lock before a locked app opens and
keep its notifications and recents hidden, along with removing the
shortcuts and widgets of locked apps.

Change-Id: If42184a2a14e81040a5d143375ef1b65ee999ce0
